{
  "title": "Spicy Cajun Salmon and Asparagus Sheet Pan - 25-Minute Dinner",
  "description": "Make this spicy Cajun salmon and asparagus sheet pan for a fast, high-protein meal that delivers 34 grams of protein in under 30 minutes. Fresh salmon fillets and tender spears roast together with bold seasonings for an easy weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "American",
